<h2>Short Bio</h2>
<p>
  Alumnus of <strong>École Normale Supérieure de Lyon</strong> and recipient of the <strong>Agrégation de Mathématiques</strong> (2025), my research focuses on boundary integral equations (BIE) and numerical analysis for wave scattering. I co-author several high-school level math practice workbooks, available in the Teaching section.
</p>

